sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Etudiant
    participant UI as UI Django (etudiant_examen_detail)
    participant ACL as Role/Auth checks
    participant SER as SoumissionSerializer
    participant DB as Base de donnees
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant CI as Pipeline CI/CD
    participant WH as ResultatWebhookAPIView

    Etudiant->>UI: POST /etudiant/examens/{id} + code_source
    UI->>ACL: verifier session + role ETUDIANT
    ACL-->>UI: autorise
    UI->>DB: charger examen autorise + fenetre horaire
    DB-->>UI: examen courant

    UI->>SER: validate(payload, request.user)
    SER->>DB: verifier groupe autorise
    SER->>DB: verifier unicite (examen, etudiant)

    alt Validation metier KO
        SER-->>UI: erreurs (groupe/date/duplicat/code vide)
        UI-->>Etudiant: message erreur
    else Validation metier OK
        SER-->>UI: data valide
        UI->>DB: create Soumission(statut=EN_TEST)
        DB-->>UI: soumission id + trace_id
        UI->>GH: creer branch + push Main.java + metadata.json

        alt Push GitHub KO
            UI->>DB: delete Soumission
            UI-->>Etudiant: echec soumission
        else Push GitHub OK
            GH-->>UI: repo_url + commit_sha
            UI->>DB: update Soumission(url_depot_git, hash_commit)
            UI-->>Etudiant: soumission envoyee, tests en cours

            CI->>GH: cloner repo solutions + repo tests
            CI->>CI: executer tests unitaires
            CI->>WH: POST /api/webhook/resultats (token, note, statut_soumission)

            WH->>DB: verifier token + charger soumission
            alt Token invalide
                WH-->>CI: 403 Token invalide
            else Token valide
                WH->>DB: update_or_create Resultat
                WH->>DB: update Soumission.statut (CORRIGE|ECHEC)
                WH-->>CI: 200/201 confirmation
            end
        end
    end
